  <title>2.10.2: Self Check</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m00544</md:content-id>
    <md:title>2.10.2: Self Check</md:title>
    <md:uuid>20f89173-5cda-4e37-95d8-8391dd96b6cd</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para dir="ltr">Samantha is feeding the horses at her barn. She has 6 buckets of oats. If each horse eats <span>\(\frac34\) bucket of oats, how many horses can she feed at most?</span></para></section>
</content>
</document>
